D[18036]={"^\nInstantly attack for (.-)%% of your main%-hand's weapon damage and an additional (.-) to up to 5 targets in a (.-) yards frontal cone%.%s*$","\nAtaca instantaneamente {{1}}% do dano da arma principal e {{2}} até 5 alvos em um cone frontal de {{3}} metros."}
D[18037]={"^Targets in a cone in front of the caster take Frost damage%.\n\nFinishing move that causes damage per combo point:\n   1 point: (.-)%-(.-) damage\n   2 points: (.-)%-(.-) damage\n   3 points: (.-)%-(.-) damage\n   4 points: (.-)%-(.-) damage\n   5 points: (.-)%-(.-) damage%s*$","Os alvos em um cone frontal do conjurador sofrem dano por Gelo.\n\nFinalizador que causa dano por ponto de combo:\n1 ponto: {{1}}-{{2}} de dano\n2 pontos: {{3}}-{{4}} de dano\n3 pontos: {{5}}-{{6}} de dano\n4 pontos: {{7}}-{{8}} de dano\n5 pontos: {{9}}-{{10}} de dano."}
