D[18548]={"^An instant strike that causes (.-) damage in addition to (.-)%% of your normal weapon damage%.  Awards (.-) combo (.-)%.%s*$","Um ataque instantâneo que causa {{1}} de dano adicional {{2}}% do dano normal de sua arma. Concede a você {{3}} ponto {{4}} de combo."}
